sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as GUI (Import button)
    participant W as widget_assembler
    participant I as transactions_importer
    participant FS as Filesystem

    U->>G: Click "Import CSV"
    G->>W: import_csv(main_window)
    W->>U: QFileDialog (pick bank CSV)
    U->>W: file path
    W->>U: QDialog (delimiter + decimal format)
    U->>W: choices
    W->>I: process_imported_csv(path, delimiter, dot_decimal)
    I->>FS: load ignore-dictionary.json
    I->>FS: load import-dictionary.json
    I->>FS: detect encodings (chardet)
    I->>FS: read imported CSV (in-memory header fix if needed)
    I->>I: apply ignore rules
    I->>FS: read existing allTransactions.csv (or initialize)
    I->>I: map columns + parse dates + normalize amounts
    I->>FS: pd.concat new rows + write allTransactions.csv
    I->>W: (is_success, message)
    W->>U: ConfirmationDialog
